WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.266
A rock blocks the way ahead. The chest is one square below the pirate.

00:00:05.266 --> 00:00:11.131
Click Turn right. Facing right, a right turn points the pirate down.

00:00:11.131 --> 00:00:17.575
Now add Move and Collect. The turn changes direction. Move changes squares.

00:00:17.575 --> 00:00:23.025
Test the code. The pirate takes the clear path and leaves the rock alone.
